<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 356 0 R
/T (The input capacitors are provided to support input voltage filtering, while the inductor and output capacitors form part of the switching converter circuit. The feedback network is used to maintain the required output voltage. The 12 V input and 5 V output connections are clearly identified in the schematic. Test points are also included to identify the respective supply voltages during subsequent testing.)
/E (The input capacitors are provided to support input voltage filtering, while the inductor and output capacitors form part of the switching converter circuit. The feedback network is used to maintain the required output voltage. The 12 V input and 5 V output connections are clearly identified in the schematic. Test points are also included to identify the respective supply voltages during subsequent testing.)
