/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 356 0 R
/T (The input interface is implemented using three 74HC165 parallel-in/serial-out shift registers. Each register supports eight parallel input signals and converts the captured data into serial form. The three registers are connected in a daisy-chain arrangement. The serial output of the first register is connected to the serial input of the second register, and the second register is connected to the third register.The input connections are organized using appropriate net labels to maintain clarity in the schematic. Decoupling capacitors are included near the shift register ICs to support stable power connections.)
/E (The input interface is implemented using three 74HC165 parallel-in/serial-out shift registers. Each register supports eight parallel input signals and converts the captured data into serial form. The three registers are connected in a daisy-chain arrangement. The serial output of the first register is connected to the serial input of the second register, and the second register is connected to the third register.The input connections are organized using appropriate net labels to maintain clarity in the schematic. Decoupling capacitors are included near the shift register ICs to support stable power connections.)
/Pg 52 0 R
/K [9]
