/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 378 0 R
/T (Footprint Selection in the STM8-Based Cable Tester In the STM8-based cable tester project, suitable footprints are required for all the major electronic components. The STM8S005K6T6 microcontroller requires a footprint matching its selected IC package. The 74HC165 shift registers require SOIC, TSSOP or another footprint corresponding to the actual package variant used. The U8C3005G requires a compatible package footprint matching its physical dimensions and pin arrangement. Similarly, the TPS563200 buck converter requires a footprint corresponding to its specified package.)
/E (Footprint Selection in the STM8-Based Cable Tester In the STM8-based cable tester project, suitable footprints are required for all the major electronic components. The STM8S005K6T6 microcontroller requires a footprint matching its selected IC package. The 74HC165 shift registers require SOIC, TSSOP or another footprint corresponding to the actual package variant used. The U8C3005G requires a compatible package footprint matching its physical dimensions and pin arrangement. Similarly, the TPS563200 buck converter requires a footprint corresponding to its specified package.)
/Pg 74 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
