/T (The power supply section is another important part of the design. The TPS563200 buck converter is used to obtain a lower regulated voltage from the 12 V input. The inclusion of the required inductor, capacitors, and feedback components provides the necessary switching converter arrangement. Separating the power supply section from the other functional blocks also makes it easier to review the power connections.)
/E (The power supply section is another important part of the design. The TPS563200 buck converter is used to obtain a lower regulated voltage from the 12 V input. The inclusion of the required inductor, capacitors, and feedback components provides the necessary switching converter arrangement. Separating the power supply section from the other functional blocks also makes it easier to review the power connections.)
