2253 0 obj
<<
/Title (The present work primarily focuses on the schematic development, component selection, circuit design, and verification of the STM8-based cable testing system. Although the hardware schematic provides the foundation for the proposed system, several additional activities can be carried out to transform the design into a complete and fully functional cable tester. One of the major future developments involves converting the verified schematic into a physical Printed Circuit Board \(PCB\) using KiCad. The components can be arranged according to their functional requirements, and the electrical connections can be established through appropriate track routing while maintaining suitable clearances, power distribution, and signal integrity. Once the PCB layout is completed and verified using Design Rule Check \(DRC\), the board can be sent for fabrication. The required electronic components can then be mounted and assembled on the fabricated PCB to obtain the complete hardware setup.)
/Dest [82 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1604 0 R
/Next 2627 0 R
>>
endobj
