2627 0 obj
<<
/Title (Another important area of future development is firmware implementation for the STM8S005K6T6 microcontroller. The firmware can be developed to control the input shift registers, output interface ICs, LCD, and keypad. The program can coordinate the operation of different circuit sections by generating the required control signals, reading the input data, processing the received information, and determining the connection status of the cable under test. Appropriate testing algorithms can be implemented to examine the continuity and connectivity of individual cable conductors. The system can further be developed to identify different cable faults, including open connections, short circuits, incorrect or crossed connections, and proper continuity between corresponding terminals. By comparing the expected cable connections with the detected input conditions, the microcontroller can determine the nature of the fault and generate the corresponding test result.)
/Dest [82 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1604 0 R
/Prev 2253 0 R
/Next 2900 0 R
>>
endobj
